        "id": "intro-comment",
        "type": "nodetool.workflows.base_node.Comment",
        "data": {
          "comment": "# Keep Only the Matches\n\nKeeps only the list items equal to a chosen value. Use it to pick out one status, tag or label from a longer list.\n\n**How it works:** \"Statuses\" holds four values. \"Fan out\" sends them one by one to \"Keep 'ok'\", which passes items equal to \"ok\". \"Matches\" shows what got through.\n\n**Try this:** Turn on invert in \"Keep 'ok'\" to get the reject list instead, or change its value to \"fail\"."
        },
